  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International HIV/AIDS Alliance 2010-2012 - IHAA 2010-2012</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">International HIV/AIDS Alliance 2010-2012</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. The International HIV/AIDS Alliance is a global partnership of     nationally based organisations working to support community action on HIV/AIDS. It is led by a secretariat in the UK. Its three main areas  of work are technical support and capacity building, development of   policy and practice and dialogue and advocacy. It works both with     vulnerable groups and in generalised epidemics. Sida gives core supp.</narrative>
